{
  "bookId": "hero-213112",
  "id": "bond-28594",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28594001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "尘埃消散，污渍消失。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28594002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "——让一切杂乱无章之物归于整洁。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28594004",
              "text": "等等，你在做什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28594003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28594004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "我看到这堆杂物，试图使用魔法协助整理。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28594005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "你知道，魔法在处理这些事情时总是很便捷。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28594007",
              "text": "这些……并不是杂物，不需要清理。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28594006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28594007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "怎么，我做错了什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28594009",
              "text": "咳，是我收藏的同人志。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28594008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28594009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "我本想用魔法简化一切，不过看来反而弄巧成拙了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28594010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "这也让我认识到，魔法也有与现代生活不兼容的时候。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28594011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "辛德瑞拉",
          "text": "至于如何处置这些同人志，你已经想好怎么办了，对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
